  <item>
    <title>05 年中盘点 | 讨一个过得去的活法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666c0c85c26e396a36c7727b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666c0c85c26e396a36c7727b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 09:25:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们收到了订阅量达到30的通知，欢欢说“令人感动”，谢谢大家。本期我们（丁丁请假）聊了聊各自上半年的生活，以及接下来的计划。祝大家听得开心🍺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 在疲惫与放纵的两极横跳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 刷短视频并不是真正的放松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 上班之后变得无趣？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> &nbsp;work hard, play harder</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 实现了俯卧撑0的突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> 播客让我们重新认识彼此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 去表达，去创造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> 欢欢说独自游荡的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 木木想脱离短视频的“魔爪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 书影推荐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提到的作品：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“外语学术普及系列”（上海外语教育出版社，2014）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《顿悟的时刻》张悦然</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我不想知道的事》德博拉·利维</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的阿勒泰》八集短剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】欢欢 木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】欢欢 木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌单】网易云音乐搜索「SS VOL 5」或点击链接<a data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10158750112&amp;userid=368577301" href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10158750112&amp;userid=368577301">music.163.com</a>打开</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】新浪微博：@偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes</span></p>]]></description>
