  <item>
    <title>04 S属性大爆发：Shit! Scold!</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6644c915251bd96e6c92c1b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6644c915251bd96e6c92c1b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 14:39:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>趁丁丁不在，欢欢和木木来一场girls talk，看看这些男的干的都是什么事。内容非虚构，如有冒犯，那冒犯的就是你。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 从自己的父亲说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 外公骂人真的很可怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 木木夸自己的哥哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 欢欢的“酒肉”前任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 驾校教练，你算老几？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 随处小便的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> 是谁在物化全世界？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> “非典型直男”丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2147">35:47</a> 我们在夸共友阿泽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 只看得到女人的胸？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】欢欢 木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】欢欢 木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌单】网易云音乐搜索「SS VOL 4」或点击链接</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10053846509&amp;userid=368577301" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=10053846509&amp;userid=368577301"><span>music.163.com</span></a><span> 打开</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】新浪微博：@偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes</span></p>]]></description>
