  <item>
    <title>03 这次第，怎一个疼字了得！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6612493cc891c06e73c01793</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6612493cc891c06e73c01793</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Apr 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每年的4月7日是世界卫生日（World Health Day），又称“世界健康日”。每个人难免生病，健康的身心似乎成了奢侈品。我们在一个雨天聊了聊各自的小毛病，还有一些比健康更重要的东西。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">0:30</a> 丁丁的住院见闻与感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 木木如何与膝盖损伤共处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 发疯文学背后的时代症候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 欢欢七百多天的整牙历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 衰老与疼痛也是疾病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3826">1:03:46</a> 衰老是精神与身体的对向运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">1:07:15</a> 母亲的痛苦与反抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4883">1:21:23</a> 要思考，不要陷入痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】丁丁 木木 欢欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌单】网易云音乐搜索「SS VOL 3」或点击链接</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/playlist?id=9694953812&amp;creatorId=93118487" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/playlist?id=9694953812&amp;creatorId=93118487"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】新浪微博：@偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes</span></p>]]></description>
