  <item>
    <title>02 关于夜晚：睡眠、梦境和酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e4347dcfdcad8d2c56fcbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e4347dcfdcad8d2c56fcbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>假期结束了，让人感到遗憾。细想下来，这样的遗憾是很熟悉的，我们舍不得每一个夜晚，就像舍不得每一次假期。于是我们决定聊一聊夜晚，以及与之相关的睡眠、梦境和酒精。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 我们的眠、不眠和失眠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 夜晚用来观察别人以及和自己对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> 现代社会要求的“无眠状态”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 瞪着眼睛胡思乱想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 不敢轻易“进入”夜晚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2424">40:24</a> 你在意自己的梦吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2686">44:46</a>失去从夜里走出来的可能性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> 如果世界上只剩下白天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3573">59:33</a> 酒精是社交货币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">60:20</a> 欢欢醉酒经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4006">66:46</a> 秒睡人也会羡慕失眠人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4178">69:38</a> 睡觉是一场小小的“死亡”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】丁丁 欢欢 木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>【歌单】网易云音乐搜索「SS VOL 2」或点击链接<a data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=9369381104&amp;userid=368577301" href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=9369381104&amp;userid=368577301">music.163.com</a>打开</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】新浪微博：@偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes</span></p>]]></description>
