  <item>
    <title>01 春节特辑：怎么过个年也会心情复杂？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c23749cace72dff89b4e93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c23749cace72dff89b4e93</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes」是一档日常闲聊播客，三位「涉世未遂」的朋友尝试聊一聊闪烁在生活河流中的惊异。</span></p><p><span>作为仪式的一种，如果一个人结婚二十多次，人们会称他为结婚大师。偶尔严肃的三位也过过二十来个年了，当之无愧的过年大师。三位过年大师这次来说说与过年有关的大事小情。大过年的，来都来了，请坐下来陪我们唠唠嗑，花生瓜子自助。</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 从轻松舒适到煎熬无聊，丁丁的春节关键词——</span><strong><span>陌生、疏远</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 从满怀期待到平淡乏味，欢欢的春节关键词——</span><strong><span>厌倦</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 从被照顾者到照顾者，木木的春节关键词——</span><strong><span>身份转变</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 春节是一场强化「</span><strong><span>宗族观念</span></strong><span>」的仪式——从祭祖中看见性别差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> “春节是</span><strong><span>劳动</span></strong><span>节”——看见节日中的女性劳动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> “把自己锁在楼顶房间的小孩”——丁丁的</span><strong><span>游离</span></strong><span>状态与</span><strong><span>观察</span></strong><span>者视角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 自我意识萌发后，</span><strong><span>不做“懂事的乖小孩”</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 私人生活被作为茶余饭后的</span><strong><span>谈资</span></strong><span>，并不是真的关心你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 过年三大话题之一：</span><strong><span>考公</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 摆酒——吃席文化中的</span><strong><span>人际政治</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 三位主播对于考公的职业</span><strong><span>想象</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">49:45</a> 当我们在谈论</span><strong><span>婚姻</span></strong><span>时我们在谈论什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3709">61:49</a> 对“</span><strong><span>年</span></strong><span>”的期待</span></p><p><span>【主播】丁丁 木木 欢欢</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】丁丁</span></p><p><span>【歌单】网易云音乐搜索「SS VOL 1」</span></p><p><span>【联系我们】新浪微博：@偶尔严肃SeriousSometimes</span></p><p><span>祝大家新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
